{"schemaVersion":2,"book":"3JN","chapters":{"1":{"1":{"text":"The elder unto the wellbeloved Gaius, whom I love in the truth.","segments":[{"text":"The elder","strong":"G4245","morph":"robinson:A-NSM-C"},{"text":"unto the wellbeloved","strong":"G27","morph":"robinson:A-DSM"},{"text":"Gaius,","strong":"G1050","morph":"robinson:N-DSM"},{"text":"whom","strong":"G3739","morph":"robinson:R-ASM"},{"text":"I","strong":"G1473","morph":"robinson:P-1NS"},{"text":"love","strong":"G25","morph":"robinson:V-PAI-1S"},{"text":"in","strong":"G1722","morph":"robinson:PREP"},{"text":"the truth.","strong":"G225","morph":"robinson:N-DSF"}],"strongs":["G25","G27","G225","G1050","G1473","G1722","G3739","G4245"]},"2":{"text":"Beloved, I wish above all things that thou mayest prosper and be in health, even as thy soul prospereth.","segments":[{"text":"Beloved,","strong":"G27","morph":"robinson:A-VSM"},{"text":"I wish","strong":"G2172","morph":"robinson:V-PNI-1S"},{"text":"above","strong":"G4012","morph":"robinson:PREP"},{"text":"all things","strong":"G3956","morph":"robinson:A-GPN"},{"text":"that","strong":"G2137","morph":"robinson:V-PPN"},{"text":"thou","strong":"G4771","morph":"robinson:P-2AS"},{"text":"mayest prosper","strong":"G2137","morph":"robinson:V-PPN"},{"text":"and","strong":"G2532","morph":"robinson:CONJ"},{"text":"be in health,","strong":"G5198","morph":"robinson:V-PAN"},{"text":"even as","strong":"G2531","morph":"robinson:ADV"},{"text":"thy","strong":"G4771","morph":"robinson:P-2GS"},{"text":"soul","strongs":["G3588","G5590"],"morphs":["robinson:T-NSF","robinson:N-NSF"]},{"text":"prospereth.","strong":"G2137","morph":"robinson:V-PPI-3S"}],"strongs":["G27","G2137","G2172","G2531","G2532","G3588","G3956","G4012","G4771","G5198","G5590"]},"3":{"text":"For I rejoiced greatly, when the brethren came and testified of the truth that is in thee, even as thou walkest in the truth.","segments":[{"text":"For","strong":"G1063","morph":"robinson:CONJ"},{"text":"I rejoiced","strong":"G5463","morph":"robinson:V-2AOI-1S"},{"text":"greatly,","strong":"G3029","morph":"robinson:ADV"},{"text":"when"},{"text":"the brethren","strong":"G80","morph":"robinson:N-GPM"},{"text":"came","strong":"G2064","morph":"robinson:V-PNP-GPM"},{"text":"and","strong":"G2532","morph":"robinson:CONJ"},{"text":"testified of","strong":"G3140","morph":"robinson:V-PAP-GPM"},{"text":"the truth","strongs":["G3588","G225"],"morphs":["robinson:T-DSF","robinson:N-DSF"]},{"text":"that"},{"text":"is"},{"text":"in"},{"text":"thee,","strong":"G4771","morph":"robinson:P-2GS"},{"text":"even as","strong":"G2531","morph":"robinson:ADV"},{"text":"thou","strong":"G4771","morph":"robinson:P-2NS"},{"text":"walkest","strong":"G4043","morph":"robinson:V-PAI-2S"},{"text":"in","strong":"G1722","morph":"robinson:PREP"},{"text":"the truth.","strong":"G225","morph":"robinson:N-DSF"}],"strongs":["G80","G225","G1063","G1722","G2064","G2531","G2532","G3029","G3140","G3588","G4043","G4771","G5463"]},"4":{"text":"I have no greater joy than to hear that my children walk in truth.","segments":[{"text":"I have","strong":"G2192","morph":"robinson:V-PAI-1S"},{"text":"no","strong":"G3756","morph":"robinson:PRT-N"},{"text":"greater","strong":"G3173","morph":"robinson:A-ASF-C"},{"text":"joy","strong":"G5479","morph":"robinson:N-ASF"},{"text":"than","strong":"G2443","morph":"robinson:CONJ"},{"text":"to hear","strong":"G191","morph":"robinson:V-PAS-1S"},{"text":"that"},{"text":"my","strong":"G1699","morph":"robinson:S-1SAPN"},{"text":"children","strong":"G5043","morph":"robinson:N-APN"},{"text":"walk","strong":"G4043","morph":"robinson:V-PAP-APN"},{"text":"in","strong":"G1722","morph":"robinson:PREP"},{"text":"truth.","strong":"G225","morph":"robinson:N-DSF"}],"strongs":["G191","G225","G1699","G1722","G2192","G2443","G3173","G3756","G4043","G5043","G5479"]},"5":{"text":"Beloved, thou doest faithfully whatsoever thou doest to the brethren, and to strangers;","segments":[{"text":"Beloved,","strong":"G27","morph":"robinson:A-VSM"},{"text":"thou doest","strong":"G4160","morph":"robinson:V-PAI-2S"},{"text":"faithfully","strong":"G4103","morph":"robinson:A-ASN"},{"text":"whatsoever","strong":"G3739","morph":"robinson:R-ASN"},{"text":"thou doest","strong":"G2038","morph":"robinson:V-ADS-2S"},{"text":"to","strong":"G1519","morph":"robinson:PREP"},{"text":"the brethren,","strongs":["G3588","G80"],"morphs":["robinson:T-APM","robinson:N-APM"]},{"text":"and","strong":"G2532","morph":"robinson:CONJ"},{"text":"to","strong":"G1519","morph":"robinson:PREP"},{"text":"strangers;","strong":"G3581","morph":"robinson:A-APM"}],"strongs":["G27","G80","G1519","G2038","G2532","G3581","G3588","G3739","G4103","G4160"]},"6":{"text":"Which have borne witness of thy charity before the church: whom if thou bring forward on their journey after a godly sort, thou shalt do well:","segments":[{"text":"Which","strong":"G3739","morph":"robinson:R-NPM"},{"text":"have borne witness","strong":"G3140","morph":"robinson:V-AAI-3P"},{"text":"of thy","strong":"G4771","morph":"robinson:P-2GS"},{"text":"charity","strongs":["G3588","G26"],"morphs":["robinson:T-DSF","robinson:N-DSF"]},{"text":"before","strong":"G1799","morph":"robinson:ADV"},{"text":"the church:","strong":"G1577","morph":"robinson:N-GSF"},{"text":"whom","strong":"G3739","morph":"robinson:R-APM"},{"text":"if"},{"text":"thou"},{"text":"bring forward on their journey","strong":"G4311","morph":"robinson:V-AAP-NSM"},{"text":"after","strong":"G516","morph":"robinson:ADV"},{"text":"a godly sort,","strongs":["G3588","G2316"],"morphs":["robinson:T-GSM","robinson:N-GSM"]},{"text":"thou shalt do","strong":"G4160","morph":"robinson:V-FAI-2S"},{"text":"well:","strong":"G2573","morph":"robinson:ADV"}],"strongs":["G26","G516","G1577","G1799","G2316","G2573","G3140","G3588","G3739","G4160","G4311","G4771"]},"7":{"text":"Because that for his name’s sake they went forth, taking nothing of the Gentiles.","segments":[{"text":"Because that","strong":"G1063","morph":"robinson:CONJ"},{"